OL,3,GNEWSARare marble sculpture mistaken for
OL,4,Agarden ornament
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rare marble sculpture could fetch up
OL,7,Fto #18,000 at auction after it spent
OL,8,Fmore than seven decades sitting
OL,9,Foutside, mistaken for a garden
OL,10,Fornament.
OL,12,FThe lichen-covered bust from 1854 was
OL,13,Fdiscovered by Thomas Jenner-Fust,
OL,14,Fdirector of Chorley's Auctioneers,
OL,15,Fduring a routine house valuation in the
OL,16,FCotswolds.
OL,18,FWhat the family thought was a
OL,19,Freconstituted stone bust turned out to
OL,20,Fbe the work of pioneering 19th-Century
OL,21,Fartist and feminist figure, Harriet
OL,22,FGoodhue Hosmer.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
